<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transportation in Deoria | Safe Two-Wheeler Shifting UP-52
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad ensure my bike arrives without scratches during Bike Transportation In Deoria?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We wrap every bike in a 7‑layer shock‑absorbent system that includes heavy‑duty bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, and custom‑cut wooden crates. The bike is then secured with wheel belt tie‑downs and anti‑vibration straps inside a climate‑controlled covered container truck. Real‑time GPS tracking and 24/7 CCTV monitoring add an extra layer of oversight, guaranteeing a zero‑scratch delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for bike parcel service from Deoria to other cities?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Customers must provide a valid government‑issued ID, the bike’s registration certificate, a signed packing declaration, and a GST‑compliant invoice if the move is corporate. For interstate shipments, an e‑Way Bill is generated automatically. Our team verifies all paperwork during the doorstep pickup to avoid any customs or transport delays.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike in real time while it’s being transported from Deoria?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every Shree Ashirwad truck is equipped with satellite GPS that feeds live location data to our customer portal. Once the bike is loaded, you receive a unique tracking link that shows the exact route, estimated arrival time, and any transit milestones, ensuring full visibility throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance mandatory for Bike Transportation In Deoria and what does it cover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">While insurance is optional, we strongly recommend it for peace of mind. Our IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covers 100 % of the declared value against accidental damage, theft, or natural calamities during transit. The policy is activated at pickup and remains in force until the bike is handed over at the destination.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does the bike transportation from Deoria to major hubs typically take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The average transit time for the 850 km corridor covering National Highway arterial routes is 2‑3 business days, depending on traffic, weather, and any scheduled stops. Our real‑time tracking lets you monitor progress, and we always aim to meet or beat the estimated delivery window.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any size or weight restrictions for bikes shipped through Shree Ashirwad in Deoria?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our specialized two‑wheeler carriers handle standard motorcycles, scooters, and even premium sports bikes up to 250 kg gross weight. Oversized or heavily modified bikes may require a custom crate and additional handling fees. Contact our support team with the bike’s specifications for a precise assessment.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the process for scheduling a doorstep pickup for my bike in Deoria?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Simply fill out the online booking form or call our Deoria office. Our coordinator will confirm the preferred date, verify documentation, and send a pre‑visit inspection checklist. On the scheduled day, a trained loading crew arrives, conducts a visual inspection, secures the bike on the hydraulic ramp trailer, and updates you with the tracking link.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
